let __v_3839 = Value::from("GCSE and A-level exams run from the middle of May to the middle of June, and the exact timetable for your subjects is published by the exam board - AQA, Edexcel, OCR or WJEC - about a year ahead, with the month-by-month dates on the board's site for the year you are sitting. Your school gives you your own timetable with the room and the start time once the entries are confirmed in February, and that is the one to go by. Results come out in the middle of August on a Thursday, with A-levels a week before GCSEs, and mocks sit in November or December before that.");
